- Selector keyed to too-narrow form: line 54. Exact input to `null_screening_ids`: `{"screening":{"records":[{"nct":"NCT1"},{"pmid":"12345"}]}}`. Consequence: the probe returns after mutating NCT and never tests the PMID-only record, so PMID vanish coverage can be falsely inferred.

